---
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<div class:list={['voice-cover', { compact }]} aria-label="界面示意：原稿对照、配音稿和复制状态">
  <div class="cover-label"><span>VOICE LOCALIZER</span><span>TW / CONCEPT</span></div>
  <div class="cover-title">说得在地，<br /><em>做得有序。</em></div>
  <div class="cover-window">
    <div class="window-top"><span class="window-dot"></span><strong>口播工作台</strong><span class="window-market">台湾 · 示例批次</span></div>
    <div class="window-body">
      <div class="mini-sidebar"><span>全部口播</span><b>03</b><hr /><span>待复制</span><span>已复制</span><span>已完成</span></div>
      <div class="mini-scripts">
        <div class="mini-row"><span>01 / 原稿与配音稿</span><b>读音待确认</b><p>我和他一起準備今天的拍攝。</p><p class="phonetic">我<mark>汗</mark>他一起準備今天的拍攝。</p><small>仅配音输入替代示意 · 字幕保留原字</small></div>
        <div class="mini-row copied"><span>02 / 配音稿</span><b>✓ 已复制</b><p>今天，想和你分享一個小發現。</p></div>
        <div class="mini-row done"><span>03 / 配音稿</span><b>✓ 已完成</b><p>一起看看今天的拍攝花絮吧。</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-bottom"><span>原稿保留 / 发音适配 / 进度标记</span><span>01 — 03</span></div>
</div>
<style>
  .voice-cover{height:100%;min-height:100%;padding:5%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 95% 0%,#77372d88,transparent 58%),#170e11;color:#f8ede5;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;overflow:hidden}
  .cover-label,.cover-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;font-size:clamp(8px,1.4cqw,12px);letter-spacing:.13em;color:#bd9388}
  .cover-title{font-size:clamp(20px,5cqw,45px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:4% 0 5%;font-weight:500}.cover-title em{font-style:normal;color:#edb3a0}
  .cover-window{border:1px solid #dcb2a533;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#281b1e;box-shadow:0 16px 40px #0004;transform:rotate(-1deg)}
  .window-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:2.3% 3%;border-bottom:1px solid #dcb2a522;font-size:clamp(8px,1.7cqw,14px)}.window-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:100%;background:#efaf99}.window-market{margin-left:auto;font-size:.8em;color:#bb9d93}
  .window-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:22% 1fr}.mini-sidebar{padding:15% 12%;border-right:1px solid #dcb2a522;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10%;font-size:clamp(8px,1.5cqw,12px);color:#b8978e}.mini-sidebar b{font-size:clamp(18px,4cqw,32px);font-weight:400;color:#f5e2d7}.mini-sidebar hr{width:100%;border:0;border-top:1px solid #dcb2a522}
  .mini-scripts{padding:3%;display:grid;gap:8px}.mini-row{border:1px solid #dcb2a522;padding:3%;border-radius:6px;font-size:clamp(8px,1.7cqw,14px)}.mini-row>span,.mini-row>b{font-size:.72em;color:#bda59b}.mini-row>b{float:right;font-weight:400}.mini-row p{margin:6px 0 0}.mini-row .phonetic{color:#f0baaa}.mini-row small{display:block;color:#bb998e;font-size:.65em;margin-top:5px}.mini-row mark{background:#d0937155;color:#ffccb8;padding:0 2px;border-bottom:1px solid #d89c7f}.mini-row.copied{background:#4b3030;border-color:#bd85745c}.mini-row.copied b{color:#f1bca9}.mini-row.done{background:#29332d;border-color:#667f665c}.mini-row.done b{color:#bed0b8}.cover-bottom{margin-top:4%;font-size:clamp(7px,1.3cqw,10px)}
  .compact{padding:4%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.compact .cover-title{font-size:4cqw;margin:2% 0;line-height:1.3}.compact .cover-title br{display:none}.compact .cover-window{transform:none}.compact .window-top{padding:2% 3%}.compact .mini-scripts{padding:2%;gap:6px}.compact .mini-row{padding:2%;font-size:1.7cqw}.compact .mini-row p{margin-top:4px}.compact .mini-sidebar{gap:8px;padding:10%}.compact .cover-bottom{margin-top:2%}.compact .mini-row small{display:none}
  @container(max-width:420px){.compact .mini-row.done{display:none}.compact .mini-sidebar{gap:4px}.compact .mini-scripts{gap:4px}.compact .mini-row{font-size:2.3cqw}.compact .cover-label,.compact .cover-bottom{font-size:1.6cqw}.compact .window-top{font-size:2.4cqw}.compact .mini-sidebar{font-size:2cqw}.compact .mini-sidebar b{font-size:4cqw}}
</style>
